    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes, it activates.",
        "question": "Does \"This Digimon can't be blocked\" in this card's [Start of Your Main Phase] effect activate even when my opponent can't trash a digivolution card?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, you can't activate it. This card’s inherited effect reads \"When this Digimon would be deleted,\" so it interrupts the deletion when it activates. Therefore, the [Gomamon] with the [On Deletion] effect is removed from the digivolution cards before the [On Deletion] effect can be triggered.",
        "question": "I have both this card and another [Gomamon] with an [On Deletion] inherited effect in the digivolution cards of the same one of my Digimon. When that Digimon is deleted, can I activate this card's inherited effect, play the other [Gomamon] from the digivolution cards, and activate that [On Deletion] inherited effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
